      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/activity#1.3.0-rc02",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>The <code>ActivityResultRegistry</code> callbacks are now properly saved and restored so callbacks are not duplicated in the savedState. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I9781617370ad24f768249df42d2ab148915097cb\">I97816</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/191893160\">b/191893160</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
